[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/issues/comments/5237556509","html_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/issues/192748#issuecomment-5237556509","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/issues/192748","id":5237556509,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA-j9z88AAAABOC7FHQ","user":{"login":"Hakureirm","id":60978629,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwOTc4NjI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60978629?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hakureirm","html_url":"https://github.com/Hakureirm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hakureirm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hakureirm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hakureirm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hakureirm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hakureirm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hakureirm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hakureirm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hakureirm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hakureirm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T08:07:45Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T08:07:45Z","body":"@pytorchbot label \"oncall: pt2\"","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/issues/comments/5237556509/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/issues/comments/5276404034","html_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/issues/192748#issuecomment-5276404034","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/issues/192748","id":5276404034,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA-j9z88AAAABOn-JQg","user":{"login":"wgu9","id":145739220,"node_id":"U_kgDOCK_N1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145739220?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wgu9","html_url":"https://github.com/wgu9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wgu9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wgu9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wgu9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wgu9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wgu9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wgu9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wgu9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wgu9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wgu9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-13T05:37:51Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T05:37:51Z","body":"I reproduced this on an RTX 5090 with driver 580.159.03 and the August 12 CUDA 13.0 nightly (`torch 2.15.0.dev20260812+cu130`). The original reproducer exits with status 139.\n\nThe direct non-CUDA-Graph fallback can receive a CUDA Graph output whose storage has already been invalidated. Generated launchers may not perform the usual data pointer check before launching. Checking each concrete tensor input with the base `torch.Tensor.data_ptr` descriptor before the three direct fallback calls changes the process exit into the existing stale-output `RuntimeError`.\n\nFocused checks pass for the reported recurrent-state case, managed input mutation, forced rerecord fallback, wrapper tensors, Tensor subclasses, fake/meta inputs, generation cloning, inference, and grad mode. The check adds about 0.69 to 0.77 microseconds per concrete tensor only on direct fallback calls. Replay is unchanged.\n\nIs this fix scope acceptable? If so, could the issue be marked `actionable`?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/issues/comments/5276404034/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]